---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Localização | 5IEQ Vila Arlindo"
  description="Veja a referência de localização e a programação da Igreja Quadrangular Vila Arlindo."
>
  <section class="site-container pb-10 pt-24 sm:pb-16 sm:pt-32">
    <div class="page-hero p-6 text-center sm:p-12">
      <p class="section-kicker">Localização e Horários</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] text-text sm:text-6xl">
        Venha nos visitar. Estamos de portas abertas para receber você.
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl section-copy">
        Abaixo estão o ponto oficial no Google Maps, os horários públicos da igreja e um mapa para
        facilitar a sua chegada até a 5ª Igreja do Evangelho Quadrangular de Vila Arlindo.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="site-container pb-12 sm:pb-16">
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]">
      <div class="section-card min-h-[320px] overflow-hidden sm:min-h-[480px]">
        <iframe
          title="Mapa da 5ª Igreja do Evangelho Quadrangular de Vila Arlindo"
          src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=-29.6458463,-52.2960489&t=k&z=17&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed"
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
          class="block h-full min-h-[320px] w-full border-0 sm:min-h-[480px]"
        ></iframe>
      </div>

      <article class="section-card p-6 sm:p-10">
        <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="icon-svg-lg">
            <path d="M12 21s6-5.13 6-10a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 4.87 6 10 6 10Z"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="11" r="2.5"></circle>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <p class="section-kicker">Informações</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold leading-none text-text sm:text-4xl">Como chegar e quando participar</h2>

        <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
          <div class="info-item">
            <div class="icon-card-row">
              <span class="icon-badge-sm" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="icon-svg">
                  <path d="M12 21s6-5.13 6-10a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 4.87 6 10 6 10Z"></path>
                  <circle cx="12" cy="11" r="2.5"></circle>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <div>
                <p class="section-kicker">Endereço</p>
                <address class="mt-2 not-italic text-base leading-7 text-muted">
                  5ª Igreja do Evangelho Quadrangular de Vila Arlindo<br />
                  Vila Arlindo<br />
                  Venâncio Aires - RS
                </address>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="info-item">
            <div class="icon-card-row">
              <span class="icon-badge-sm" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="icon-svg">
                  <path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18"></path>
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="7.5"></circle>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <div>
                <p class="section-kicker">Coordenadas</p>
                <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted">-29.6458463, -52.2960489</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="info-item">
            <div class="icon-card-row">
              <span class="icon-badge-sm" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="icon-svg">
                  <path d="m4 18 5.5-12 5 8 5.5-8"></path>
                  <path d="M17 6h3v3"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <div>
                <p class="section-kicker">Como chegar</p>
                <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted">
                  Use o botão abaixo para abrir a rota diretamente no Google Maps com o ponto já
                  confirmado da igreja.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/5%C2%AA+Igreja+do+Evangelho+Quadrangular+de+Vila+Arlindo/@-29.6458416,-52.2986292,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x951c971cdc06b81d:0xbd292610bdb25035!8m2!3d-29.6458463!4d-52.2960489!16s%2Fg%2F11vhtm1f9m"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="mt-8 inline-flex w-full justify-center rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-[#8e5e24] sm:w-auto"
        >
          Abrir rota no Google Maps
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="site-container pb-10 sm:pb-16">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="feature-card">
        <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="icon-svg-lg">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"></circle>
            <path d="M12 8v4l2.5 2.5"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <p class="section-kicker">Domingo</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-text">1º domingo · 14h30</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-muted">Encontro de mulheres.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="icon-svg-lg">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"></circle>
            <path d="M12 8v4l2.5 2.5"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <p class="section-kicker">Domingo</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-text">2º domingo · 9h</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-muted">Encontro de homens.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="icon-svg-lg">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"></circle>
            <path d="M12 8v4l2.5 2.5"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <p class="section-kicker">Quarta-feira</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-text">19h</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-muted">Culto de oração.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="icon-svg-lg">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"></circle>
            <path d="M12 8v4l2.5 2.5"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <p class="section-kicker">2ª sexta</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-text">20h</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-muted">Encontro de jovens.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="icon-svg-lg">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"></circle>
            <path d="M12 8v4l2.5 2.5"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <p class="section-kicker">Sábado</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-text">19h</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-muted">Culto da família.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="icon-svg-lg">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"></circle>
            <path d="M12 8v4l2.5 2.5"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <p class="section-kicker">Sábado</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-text">19h</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-muted">Encontro de crianças.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="icon-svg-lg">
            <path d="M7 17.5A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 11.5 13H16"></path>
            <path d="M16.5 6.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 14 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 2.5-2.5Z"></path>
            <path d="M6.5 6.5h5"></path>
            <path d="M6.5 10h4"></path>
            <path d="M16 15.5h.01"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <p class="section-kicker">Instagram</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-text">@5ieq.vilaarlindo</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-muted">Acompanhe a programação e os avisos públicos.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="site-container pb-14 sm:pb-20">
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]">
      <article class="section-card p-6 sm:p-10">
        <p class="section-kicker">Perguntas Frequentes</p>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4">
          <div class="info-item">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-text">Preciso avisar antes de ir?</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted">
              Não. Você pode chegar diretamente em qualquer um dos encontros públicos listados acima.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-text">Posso ir com minha família?</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted">
              Sim. A proposta da comunidade é acolher pessoas e famílias com simplicidade e respeito.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-text">Qual a melhor forma de encontrar o local?</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted">
              O caminho mais direto é abrir a rota no Google Maps usando o botão desta página.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="media-block overflow-hidden">
        <img
          src="/images/vila-arlindo.jpeg"
          alt="Entrada da Igreja Quadrangular Vila Arlindo"
          class="h-72 w-full object-cover object-[58%_center] sm:h-full"
        />
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
